  {
    "id": "moxa_bidirectional",
    "proto": "moxa",
    "summary": "S3/T-MOXA-S3-01: 双向 4 块流（up WR/down RT 交替），事件模式每块 1 包，11 包 = 3 握手 + 4 数据 + 4 挥手",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "tcp": {
            "mss": 536,
            "dst_port": 4800
          }
        },
        {
          "moxa": {
            "stream": [
              {
                "direction": "up",
                "payload": "WR"
              },
              {
                "direction": "down",
                "payload": "RT"
              },
              {
                "direction": "up",
                "payload": "WR"
              },
              {
                "direction": "down",
                "payload": "RT"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "has_handshake": true,
      "negotiated": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "directional": true,
      "has_payload": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "tcp.dstport",
          "value": "4800"
        },
        {
          "packet": 5,
          "field": "tcp.srcport",
          "value": "4800"
        },
        {
          "field": "tcp.dstport",
          "distinct_values": [
            "4800"
          ],
          "distinct_exclude": [
            "12345"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "frames": [
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "57 52"
        },
        {
          "packet": 5,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "52 54"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "S3: down 段 srcport=4800（服务器端口对换）；directional 双向",
        "packet5 tcp.srcport=4800 是 down 端口对换唯一守卫（设计 §6.3/R1）",
        "dstport distinct_exclude 滤下行握手/挥手包 dst=客户端源端口 12345"
      ],
      "packet_count": 11
    },
    "notes": [
      "S3: 事件模式 4 数据块各 1 包(WR/RT 交替 up/down);11 包=3+4+4;directional≥2 ip.src;packet5 srcport=4800"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "moxa_sessions_multi",
    "proto": "moxa",
    "summary": "S4/T-MOXA-S4-01: 多串口会话 = flows=3，src_port 12345/12346/12347，dst_port 恒 4800，3×8=24 包；聚合用 distinct_exclude 滤掉对端口",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "tcp": {
            "src_port": {
              "strategy": "inc",
              "range": [
                12345,
                12347
              ],
              "step": 1
            },
            "dst_port": 4800
          }
        },
        {
          "moxa": {
            "stream": [
              {
                "payload": "hello"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "strategy_fc": {
      "type": "flows",
      "value": 3
    },
    "expect": {
      "has_handshake": true,
      "has_payload": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "tcp.srcport",
          "distinct_values": [
            "12345",
            "12346",
            "12347"
          ],
          "distinct_exclude": [
            "4800"
          ]
        },
        {
          "field": "tcp.dstport",
          "distinct_values": [
            "4800"
          ],
          "distinct_exclude": [
            "12345",
            "12346",
            "12347"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "S4: 3 流 × 8 包 = 24；流交织 → distinct_values 聚合断言"
      ],
      "terminates": true,
      "packet_count": 24
    },
    "notes": [
      "S4: flows=3 策略级多会话;src 12345-47/dst 4800;distinct_exclude 滤对端端口",
      "四元组动态（src_port inc 12345..12347）满足静态复制门；解析值与保底递增同值，断言不变（dameng_multi_flow_dynamic 先例）",
      "spec_json.flow_control 为死配置（全仓无读取方，真机制是 case 级 strategy_fc，离线执行器 layer_chain_suite_test.go 与 MCP 均读它）——按 §1.12 删。"
    ]
  },
